# Poetic Personality Chatbot

## Overview

An interactive chatbot that uses Google's Gemini model and prompt engineering to transform user messages into short poems with a consistent poetic personality.

## Objective

* Convert user messages into original poems
* Create a consistent poetic personality named "Verse"
* Provide a natural typing animation

## Work Done

* Integrated Gemini using the `google-genai` SDK
* Designed a structured prompt with few-shot examples
* Added emotional tone matching
* Implemented an offline fallback for API failures
* Added line-by-line typing animation
* Built an interactive chatbot loop

## Tools & Technologies

* Python
* Google Gemini
* Google Gen AI SDK
* Google Colab
* Prompt Engineering

## Key Insights

* Prompt engineering strongly influences LLM personality and output
* Few-shot examples help maintain a consistent style
* Fallback handling improves chatbot reliability

## Learning Outcome

* Gained experience working with LLM APIs
* Learned practical prompt engineering techniques
* Understood how prompts can shape AI creativity and personality
